  "note": "Instrument v2 — supersedes v1. Adds the \"aware\" sub-section to Follow × Exposure (heard_story): a diagnostic branch, sourced from British Youth for Christ's 2025 Z-A Growing Spirituality survey, that asks who/where someone first encountered Jesus and what made it meaningful — but only of respondents who are NOT (yet) a follower (the exact logical complement of the existing maturity gate: orientation not in the exploring-or-further set, AND identify_as_follower <= 2), so committed followers are not asked redundant exposure questions. A parallel item asks those who have never heard the story why not. All four items are diagnostic (scored: false) — they carry no validated direction/weight for the Index and are not from the same fielding as the rest of the instrument (YFC surveyed UK 11-18s, not the 13-30 global NGJFI cohort), so treat as illustrative pending researcher review. Subject to researcher revision — never hard-code into UI or scoring.",
  "core_note": "`core: true` marks the NGC12 — the memorable 12-item core that can be run alone.",
